vr_reset
VR Reset
tip_1
Keep the "Reset" control pressed for 3 seconds to reset the bike to track
tip_2
Keep the "Track Marker" control pressed for a second to set it, tap the control to reset the bike to it
tip_3
The keys from 1 to 0 are bound to the autochat messages
tip_4
The F5 key shows / hides the chat history on track
tip_5
Shift + C cycles between the onboard view position adjustments. Use the up and down arrow keys to move the view; left and right keys pressed together to reset it
